  "instruction": "Collaboratively assemble a sealed parcel and deliver it into another room. Franka A must position the loaded package base at the shared packing station while Franka B retrieves a separate lid. Franka B must wait for the base, physically fit and seal the lid, and return home. The Unitree Go2 with Z1 must verify delivery readiness, wait for the measured package seal, pick the assembled parcel, retain it throughout transport, approach the initially closed room door, and use the closed-door branch to push the hinged door open and cross the doorway. It must then continue into the delivery room, place the sealed parcel at the delivery station, and stow its arm. Every shared area must be explicitly acquired and released; no robot may wait while holding a shared resource; all waits and acquisitions must be bounded; and all robots must finish empty and home or stowed.",
